config MTK_GED_COMPAT
	tristate "MediaTek GED /proc/ged bridge for vendor graphics blobs"
	depends on PROC_FS && DMA_SHARED_BUFFER
	help
	  Provides /proc/ged with the bridge ioctl ABI of the MediaTek GED
	  driver from the MT6765 Linux 4.19 vendor kernel, as used by the
	  stock libged.so and libgralloc_extra.so. The gralloc_extra (GE)
	  metadata objects and dma-buf naming are implemented; GPU DVFS,
	  KPI and frame-rate hints are accepted without a backend.

	  If unsure, say N.
